From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] The place name sign at the wider screen's left edge
 (SDK_PORT_3DS)

The 3DS remaster draws the upper screen wider than the DS's. The place
name sign (the map name pop-up: a window the width of the screen, the sign
drawn in its left 17 tiles) tells the port it goes to the screen's left
edge while it shows (NitroPort_WindowAnchor, when its frame is drawn; off
again when it's hidden, as the field's menu shares its BG); the port's 2D
renderer moves those tiles there.
---
 src/overlay005/map_name_popup.c | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/overlay005/map_name_popup.c b/src/overlay005/map_name_popup.c
index 079404c2..c940dcf5 100644
--- a/src/overlay005/map_name_popup.c
+++ b/src/overlay005/map_name_popup.c
@@ -19,6 +19,13 @@
 #include "sys_task_manager.h"
 #include "text.h"
 
+#ifdef SDK_PORT_3DS
+// The 3DS remaster draws the upper screen wider than the DS's: the place
+// name sign goes to its left edge while it shows
+// (3ds_port/nitro/include/nitro_port_wide.h).
+extern void NitroPort_WindowAnchor(const void *window, int side, int widthTiles);
+#endif
+
 #define POPUP_WIDTH_TILES  17
 #define POPUP_HEIGHT_TILES 5
 #define POPUP_SIZE_TILES   (POPUP_WIDTH_TILES * POPUP_HEIGHT_TILES)
@@ -97,6 +104,9 @@ static void MapNamePopUp_DrawWindowFrame(MapNamePopUp *mapPopUp, s32 strWidth)
 
     Window_CopyToVRAM(&mapPopUp->window);
     Heap_Free(mapPopUp->tiles);
+#ifdef SDK_PORT_3DS
+    NitroPort_WindowAnchor(&mapPopUp->window, -1, POPUP_WIDTH_TILES);
+#endif
 }
 
 static void MapNamePopUp_Reset(MapNamePopUp *mapPopUp)
@@ -259,6 +269,9 @@ void MapNamePopUp_Hide(MapNamePopUp *mapPopUp)
     }
 
     Window_ClearAndCopyToVRAM(&mapPopUp->window);
+#ifdef SDK_PORT_3DS
+    NitroPort_WindowAnchor(&mapPopUp->window, 0, 0);
+#endif
     Bg_SetOffset(mapPopUp->bgConfig, BG_LAYER_MAIN_3, BG_OFFSET_UPDATE_SET_Y, 0);
 
     BgConfig *bgConfig = mapPopUp->bgConfig;
